<cap:headline>River Adhwara Group at Kamtaul in Darbhanga district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 pm today.</cap:headline>
<cap:description>River Adhwara Group at Kamtaul in Darbhanga district of Bihar continues to flow in severe flood situation at 6:00 pm today. At 6:00 pm, it was flowing at a level of 50.19 m with falling trend which is 0.19 m above its Danger Level of 50 m and 2.80 m below its previous HFL of 52.99 m (12/08/1987).</cap:description>
